msgid "minutes of inactivity"
msgstr "minutes d'inactivité"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:1801
msgid ""
"A cart with a known email and no activity for this long is marked as "
"abandoned."
msgstr ""
"Un panier associé à une adresse e-mail connue et sans activité pendant cette "
"durée est marqué comme abandonné."

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:1810
msgid "Show a signup popup to store visitors (not shown on the checkout page)"
